OL,4,G0232FThe Documentary
OL,5,     GWith young men from Syria, Egypt
OL,6,     Gand Yemen ending up on the
OL,7,     Gfrontline in Ukraine, BBC Eye
OL,8,     Ginvestigates the woman many say
OL,9,     Gtricked them into fighting for
OL,10,     Gthe Russian army.
