OL,4,G0350FWitness History
OL,5,     GIn 1943 the most audacious hoax
OL,6,     Gof WW2 began. The Nazis
OL,7,     Gdiscovered secret papers on the
OL,8,     Gbody of a British officer washed
OL,9,     Gashore in Spain. They didn't know
OL,10,     Gevery detail was false.
